<html><head><title>Researchers role</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><p><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-GB" lang="EN-GB" class="TextRun SCXW74329261 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">Transdisciplinary education is derived from transdisciplinary research, where scientists from various disciplines collaborate with non-academic partners on a 'wicked problem' (OECD, 2020). The research perspective is crucial in transdisciplinary education to guide and ensure the research-driven approach in the project, such as problem identification and the integration of types of knowledge and methods (Klein, 2014).</span><span class="EOP SCXW74329261 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW80318364 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW80318364 BCX8" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" paraid="430246574" paraeid="{0aa90c6c-dc3a-49ee-8b89-a9eaf2496b2b}{37}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW80318364 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">References:</span><span class="EOP SCXW80318364 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW80318364 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW80318364 BCX8" paraid="1416944247" paraeid="{b2e22d67-d781-4660-bf0c-4c1bf42a3854}{99}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: prese